    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "So lame..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Guys who try to show off, bow down and get refused are so lame..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "How embar- rassing"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "rather, you were really cool!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "No... there's no way I'd think that...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "(name) On the"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...oh yeah?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well then, that's good?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yep!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This is no time to be ashamed."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...Even if we don't have the data,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Head- quarters should have the investi- gallon's progress reports."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We'll do something somehow ....!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "“The"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "....okay!"
    },
    {
